      "value": "@{5ac57845180a7e323c02d48d|full_name} The 'Softlock' issue is totally fixed for me now. I can take new prints and delete and edit anything I see in my print gallery.\n\nSeeing this issue now however, don't know if it's new. https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/you-cant-save-your-own-deleted-vrc-prints-back-to-your-own-account",
