  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1.) Use an account effected by the issue (not mine anymore)\n\n2.) Create a VRC+ Print, print it in-world.\n\n3.) Check Prints via Profile -> Media -> Prints\n\n4.) Observe print you just took is not listed.\n\n5.) Verify print does exist via API, it is not being displayed in the UI, and thus can't be re-printed or deleted.\n\nAdditional info:\n\nSomething can be bugged with prints, after taking them, and printing them, they do not appear in your list of prints after a certain date, and so cannot be deleted except via VRCX, and cannot be reprinted later since they are not there.\n\nThis persists across cache clears and reinstall so I pretty confident it's not a local caching issue.",
